%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "14px", "actorBkg": "#eef3fb", "actorBorder": "#2f5fa7", "noteBkgColor": "#fff8e1"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer app
    participant A as API
    participant D as SQLite
    participant W as Worker
    participant O as Ollama

    rect rgb(238, 243, 251)
    Note over C,D: Upload
    C->>A: POST /homes/me/documents (PDF)
    A->>D: insert document and job (queued)
    A-->>C: job_id
    end

    par Worker runs the job
        rect rgb(253, 238, 222)
        Note over W,O: Job (180 s limit)
        W->>D: take queued job, status running
        W->>O: extract facts from PDF text
        O-->>W: field candidates
        W->>D: merge and save profile
        W->>W: match catalogue (code)
        W->>O: write why and benefit
        O-->>W: texts
        W->>D: save risk_texts, job done
        end
    and App polls the job
        loop every 2 s, stop after 200 s
            C->>A: GET /jobs/{id}
            A->>D: read job
            A-->>C: status, stage
    end
    end

    rect rgb(227, 241, 229)
    Note over C,D: Read results
    C->>A: GET /homes/me/risks
    A->>D: matches and texts
    A-->>C: risk list (max 5)
    C->>A: GET /homes/me/risks/{id}
    A-->>C: risk, evidence, up to 3 partners
    C->>A: GET /homes/me/maintenance
    A-->>C: due dates and status
    end
